## Interface: 16001, 120105, 120107
## Title: ARL Extensions: Quality of Life
## Notes: Sleeping Bag reminders, Fishing Pole Alert, Spec Gear Swap and LFG Role Filter.
## Author: aredpanda, andreg1
## Version: 0.1.0
## Group: ARLExtensions
## Dependencies: ARLExtensions
## LoadOnDemand: 1
